ock. In two-player split screen mode you go head to head against another player.\n\nThere are 5 boats to choose from, and you can unlock another 15 while progressing through the game. All boat vary in speed, acceleration and handling.\n\nThe tracks are set in canals of major cities, like London, Amsterdam and New York. Each track has a high or low tide, and you can race at day time or during the night time.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/aqua-gt", "videos": [{"id": 88372, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "080mNeEovOY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=080mNeEovOY", "title": "AQUA GT CHAMPIONSHIP - 1080P 60FPS - SEGA DREAMCAST", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/080mNeEovOY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}